WEBVTT

00:00:00.617 --> 00:00:04.068
Tutorial three. Inclusion rules and subsets.

00:00:08.336 --> 00:00:16.896
Build your inclusion criteria as rules. Each rule has a column, an operator and a value. Add as many as your protocol needs.

00:00:17.053 --> 00:00:25.148
Each rule shows how many rows remain, and how many each group lost. It is a live version of the participant flow diagram.

00:00:25.441 --> 00:00:28.613
The group counts in the sidebar follow every change.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:36.970
Subsets run a complete analysis for each value of a column. For example, one preset can give a full analysis for each center.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:45.188
Preview the rows that will be analyzed. You can export them as a CSV file, with the group of each row, to keep with the manuscript.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:50.533
StandardEyes. For ophthalmologists, by ophthalmologists.

